{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0637.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Ibid. fr. 13. — Initio scribe : Parthenius Erot. c. 33 : Περὶ Ἄσσάονος. Ἱστορεῖ Ξάνθος Λυδιακοῖς καὶ Νεάνθης β' καὶ Σιμμίᾶς ὁ Ῥόδιος. Διαφόρως πλ. Cf. Neanthis fr. 28, tom. III, p. 9. Subjunge schol. Eurip. Phœn. 159 : Ξάνθος δὲ ὁ Λύδιος (sc. τὴν Νιόβην φησὶ παῖδας ἔχειν) δέκα καὶ δέκα ἐκ Φιλόττου τοῦ Ἀσσυρίου, ἐς φicei ἐν Σιπύλῳ· [δὲ ἀνῃρῆθη ἐν κυνηγesiῳ ὑπὸ ἀρκτου.] Postrema addit codex Flo- rent., qui in antec. omittit verba καὶ δέκα. Vul- gata significat : δέκα ἄρρενας καὶ δέκα θηλείας. Nomen Φιλόττου ex Parthenio reposuit Valckena- rius pro vg. Φιλοξένου. Idem deinde pro τοῦ Ἄσσυρίου ex eodem Parth. scribendum proponit : θυ (i. e. θυγάτερα) οὖσαν Ἄσσάονος. De re v. Creuzer. Symbolik IV, p. 553, 781 sq."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0637.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Post fr. 14 insere : Joann. Lydus De mensib. III, c. 14 : Ὅτι δὲ τὸν ἐνιαυτὸν ὡς θεὸν ἐτίμησαν, δήλον ἐξ αὐτῆς τῆς Λυδῶν βασιλίδος πόλεως. Σάρδιν γὰρ αὐτὴν καὶ Ἑυάριν ὁ Ξάνθος καλεῖ· τὸ δὲ Σάρδιν ὄνομα εἰ τις κατὰ ἀριθμὸν ἀπολογισεται, πέντε καὶ ἐξήκοντα καὶ τριακόσιας εὑρήσει συνάγων μονάδας· ὡς κάντευθεν εἶναι δῆλον, πρὸς τιμὴν Ἡλίου, τοῦ τοσαύταις ἡμέραις τὸν ἐνιαυτὸν συνάγοντος, Σάρδιν ὀνομασθῆναι τὴν πόλιν. Νέον δὲ Σάρδιν τὸ νέον ἔτος ἐτι καὶ νῦν λέγεσθαι τῷ πλήθει συνομολογεῖται· εἰσὶ δὲ οἱ φασὶ τῇ Λυδῶν ἀρχαίᾳ φωνῇ τὸν ἐνιαυτὸν καλεῖσθαι Σάρδιν. « Eodem modo Nilus pro anno accipiebatur, computatis hujus nominis literis item efficientibus anni dierum numerum. Cf. Heliodor. Æthiop. IX, 22, p. 381 ed. Coray., quem locum tractat Creuzer. in Com- mentatt. Herodot. I, p. 184, nostri quoque facta mentione. » ROETHER. Cf. Creuzer. Symbolik II, p. 624, 632."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0637.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "P. 43, fr. 27. — Scribe : Ξάνθος δὲ ὁ Λύδιος περὶ τὴν ὀκτωκαιδεκάτην, ὡς δὲ Διονύσιος περὶ τὴν πεντεκαίδεκάτην, Θάσον ἐκτίσθαι."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0637.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Ibid. post fragm. 27 inserendus locus Hephæ- stion. De metris p. 14 ed. Gaisf. : Προτάσσεται δὲ ἡμίφωνον ὑγροῦ.. καὶ τὸ σ τοῦ λ, κατὰ πάθος, ὡς ἐν τῷ μᾶσσης, καὶ σπανίως τοῦ ν, ὡς Πάσσης καὶ Μάσσης, ἀ δὲ ὀνόματα (sc. ποταμῶν) παρὰ Ξάνθῳ εἰσὶν ἐν τοῖς Λυδικοῖς. Eadem, omissa Xanthi mentione, gramm. cod. Barocc. ap. Gaisford. ad Hephæst., et Etym. M. p. 249, 18 : Δάσληρα. Δεῖ γινώσκειν ὅτι τὸ Δάσληρα (ὄνομά ἐστι λίμνης) καὶ Βρυμὸς (ἐστι δὲ ὄνομα βασιλέως) καὶ Πάσσης καὶ Μάσσης (ὀνόματα ποταμῶν) καὶ Ὀσροήνη (ὅπερ τινὲς Ὀρροήνη λέγουσιν· ἐστι δὲ χώρα οὕτω καλουμένη ἐν Συρίᾳ) τὸ σ ἐν συλλήψει ἔχει μετὰ τῶν ἐπιφερομένων συμφώνων. —"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0638.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(*) Preller. I. I. p. 9 scribit : καὶ Πελίαν ὠνόμαζεν αὐτόν. Schneidewin. Conject. crit. p. 99 (a Prellero p. 14 citatus) καὶ τὸν Ν. ὠνόμαζεν, adeo ut τὸν sit pro τούτων. Nescio an μέν post τὸν supplendum sit, adeo ut in media enuntiatione excerp tor substituerit, perpendendum fuisset : τὸν δὲ Νηλέα ἐκάλεσεν etc. Cf. Apollodor. I, 9, 8 : Ὁ δὲ ὑποφορβὸς ἀμφοτέροὺς τοὺς παῖδας ἀνελέμενος ἔθρεψε, καὶ τὸν μὲν πεπλιωθέντα Πελίαν ἐκάλεσε, τὸν δὲ ἕτερον Νηλέα. Schol. II. x, 334 : Τυρὼ γὰρ ἡ Σαλμωνέως γεννήσασα δύο παῖδας ἐκ Ποσειδῶνος, παρὰ τοῖς Ἐνιπέας τοῦ ποταμοῦ βαίθροις κατέθεκε. Τὸν μὲν οὖν ἕτερον κύων, ἀφαιρεθέντων αὐτῆς τῶν πόνων (l. γόνων; τέκνων Did.), παρέχουσα θηλὴν ἔθρεψε· τὸν δὲ ἕτερον ἵππος κατὰ τὸ μέτωπον ἐπάτησεν. Ἐπελθόντες οὖν οἱ ἱππορφοβοὶ ἀνελέμενοι τε τὰ παῖδια ἕτερον, καὶ ἀνόμεσαν τὸν μὲν, ἐπεὶ ἐκ συνδρομῆς αἵματος ἐπελιώθη, Πελίαν, τὸν δ' ἕτερον, ἐπεὶ κύων κατηλέσεν, Νηλέα. Quæ probabiliter ex Hellanico derivata."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "τὰ Περσικά)."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ΑΤΛΑΝΤΙΑΣ ἐν βιβλ. β'."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(Ἑλλ. ἐν α' Ἀτλαντικῶν),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἀπὸ τοῦ Ἄτλαντος καταγέσθαι"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Ἑλλάνικος ἐν τῇ Ἀτλαντιάδι ἀπὸ τοῦ ποιητοῦ φησιν ὀνομάσθαι τοὺς Ὁμηρίδας"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.6", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἐν Φορωνίδι."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(ἐν τῇ Ἀτλαντιάδι)."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.8", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Λῆδας τῆς Καλυδωνίας"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.9", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Ἑλλάνικος ἐν α' Τρωικῶν."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.10", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(α' Τρωικ.),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.11", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Τρωὸς δ' αὐ τρεῖς παῖδες ἀμύμονες ἐξεγένοντο, Ἴλος τ' Ἀσσαρακός τε καὶ ἀντίθεος Γανυμήδης,"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.12", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Τρωὸς καὶ Καλλιρρόης τῆς Σκαμάνδρου, ὡς Ἑλλάνικος."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.13", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Ἴλος δ' αὐ τέκνον ἱδὸν ἀμύμονα Διομήδοντα."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.14", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Ἔς Εὐρυδίκης τῆς Ἀδράστου"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.15", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Ἔς Βατείας τῆς Τεύκρου, ὡς Ἑλλάνικος."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.16", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Ὅδε Ἄσωπὸς ποταμὸς Ὠκεανοῦ καὶ Τήθους κτλ.,"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.17", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἡ Ἄσωπις"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.18", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Μαρτυρεῖ τούτοις καὶ Ἑλλάνικος ἐν τῇ ἐπιγραφομένῃ Ἄσωπίδι."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.19", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(Ὁμοίως τῷ ποιητῇ καὶ Ἑλλάνικος τὴν Ἐριώπην μητέρα Αἴαντος φησι)."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.20", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "μία πόλις τῶν ἐν Χερρονήσῳ, καθά φασιν Ἑλλάνικος ἐν α' Τρωικῶν,"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.21", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Μιλτιάδης, ὃς ὤκισε Χερρόνησον· μαρτυρεῖ τούτοις καὶ Ἑλλάνικος ἐν τῇ ἐπιγραφομένῃ Ἄσωπίδι,"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.22", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Κριθώτη, πόλις τῶν ἐν Χερρονήσῳ, κατοικισθεῖσα ὑπὸ Ἀθηναίων τῶν μετὰ Μιλτιάδην ἐκεῖ παραγενομένων."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.23", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(β' Τρ.),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0639.24", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(β' Τρ.),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(β' Τρωικ.)"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(Ἕλλ. ἐν τοῖς Περὶ Λυδίας);"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Οὐδ' Ἕλληνικὸς Ὀμηρικὸς, Δουλίχιον τὴν Κεφαλληνίαν λέγων."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Ὁ Θώνος βασιλεύς ἦν τοῦ Κανώδου καὶ τοῦ Ἡρακλείου στόματος, δὲ πρὶν μὲν ἰδεῖν Ἕλληνν ἐφιλοτιμεῖτο Μενέλανον· ἰδὼν δὲ αὐτὴν ἐπιχειρεῖ βιάζεσθαι. Ὁ γυνὴς Μενέλαος ἀναίρει αὐτόν· οὐδὲν ἦν τοῖς Θώνοις ὀνόμασται, ὡς ἱστορεῖ Ἕλληνικὸς."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ΑΤΟΙΣ βιβλ. δ'."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.6", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(α' Ἀτθ.),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(α' Ἀτθ.),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.8", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(α' Ἀτθ.),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.9", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Κάδμιοι, οἱ Πριηνῖες, ὡς Ἕλλανικὸς."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.10", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ὡς... Ἕλλ. ἐν τῇ πρώτῃ"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.11", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "οἱ θῆτες"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.12", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(β' Ἀτθ.),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.13", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(β' Ἀτθ.),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.14", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(β' Ἀτθ.),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.15", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "βραχέως τε καὶ τοῖς χρόνοις οὐκ ἀκριδῶς."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.16", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(δ' Ἀτθ.), Πηγαί, τόπος ἐν Μεγάρῳς"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.17", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "διεξιὼν τὰ ἐπὶ Ἀντιγένους"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.18", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Τῷ προτέρῳ ἔτει ἐπὶ Ἀντιγένους Ἕλλάνικος"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.19", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἀλλὰ νικᾷ) φησι χρησῶν νόμισμα κοπῆναι· καὶ Φιλόχορος"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.20", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ὁμοίως, τὸ ἐκ τῶν χρυσῶν Νικῶν."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0640.21", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ΛΕΣΒΙΑΚΑ (Αἰολικά), βιβλ. β'."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Ἕλλ. ἐν τῷ Περὶ Χίου κτίσεως."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "πρὸς τὸ σῖνεσθαι τοὺς πλησίον) συνώχισαν ἑαυτοὺς ἀναμὶς ὡς ἤλθον αὐτοῖς καὶ κατέλιπον ναῦς πέντε,"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Περὶ δὲ τῆς Ὀρέστου εἰς τὴν Αἰολίδα ἀποικίας Ἕλλ. ἐν τῷ πρώτῳ Αἰολικῶν δεδήλωκεν,"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Τὰ δὲ περὶ τῆς ἀποικίας Λέσβου Ἕλλ. ὁ Λέσβιος ἱστορεῖ ἐν α' Αἰολικῶν,"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ΠΕΡΣΙΚΑ, βιβλ. β'."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.6", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(α' Περσ.),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(ἐς τὰ Ἀρταῖα)"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.8", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(α' Περσ.),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.9", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(β' Περσ.),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.10", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(β' Περσ.),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.11", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ΙΕΡΕΙΑΙ ἹΗΡΑΣ, βιβλ. γ'."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.12", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "('Ιερ. α'),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.13", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "('Ιερ. α'),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.14", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "('Ιερ. α'),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.15", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Ἀδμήτη, θυγάτηρ Εὐρυσθέως, ἐν Ἄργει ἱεράτευσεν ἔτη λη'"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.16", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "νη'). Αἱ ἀπὸ ταύτης τὴν ἱερσύνην διαδεξάμεναι Φαλίδες καλοῦνται.]"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.17", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "('Ιερ. α'),"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.18", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Ἦρας Ἀργείας ἱέρεια Ἀδμάτα, Εὐρυσθέως καὶ Ἀδμάτας τὰς Ἀμφιδάμαντος ἔτη νη']"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0641.19", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἐπειδὴ οἱ Πέρσαι πάντα τῇ βουλῇ διεπράττοντο,"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0642.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "dicit : Ἐντεῦθεν (sc. ἀπὸ τῆς Ἡρακλέους ἀποθέσεως) ἐπὶ"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0642.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "τὴν Κάστορος καὶ Πολυδεύκους ἀποθέσιν, ἔτη πεντήκοντα"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0642.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "τρία. Ἐνταῦθα πού καὶ ἡ Ἰλίου κατάληψις : id ipsum ad"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0643.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "οὕτως Ἐπαζρόδιτος, ὡς λέγεις, γράφει· Γέλας δ' ἐκλῆθη τῷ πάχην πολλὴν φέρειν· κλῆσιν ἔχει γὰρ ἡ πάχην ταύτην φέρει. [γεῖ ὁ Πρόξενος δὲ σὺν τισιν ἄλλοις (σὺν Ἑλλανίχῳ gloss.) λέΓελῶνος ἀνδρὸς ἐκ τινος Γέλαν πόλιν. (Οὕτος ὁ Γέλων υἱὸς Ἀτνης καὶ Ὑμάρου gloss.) Ἐξ Ἀντιφίμου δ' αὐ γελώτος τις λέγει·"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0643.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "χρησμῷ μαθὼν γὰρ ὡς πόλιν μὲν ἐκκτίσει [μέλλη κτίγελᾶ, δοχῆςας τῶν ἀνελπίστων τοῦτε [σαι;?] κλῆσιν ὧνεν τέθεικε τῇ πόλει Γέλαν."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0643.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "— LIBER III. Fr. 52, ubi ex Ἱερεῶν Ὦρχας γ' af- feruntur verba : Ἀμβρακιωτῶν καὶ οἱ μετ' αὐτῶν Χάονες καὶ Ἡπειρώται, « ubi mihi non dubium, Prellerus ait, quin sermo sit de bello inter Acar- nanes et Ambraciotas gesto Ol. 87, 4. 429. » V. Thucyd. II, 80 : Τοῦ δ' αὐτοῦ θέρους οὐ πολλῷ ὕστερον τούτων Ἀμβρακιώται καὶ Χάονες βουλήμενοι Ἀχαρνανίαν πᾶσαν καταστρέψασθαι κτλ... Ἐστρατεύσαντο δὲ μετὰ Χάονων καὶ Θεσπρωτοὶ ἀδασίλευτοι κτλ."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0643.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Nº. 2655 : [*** ἔδοξε τῇ βουλῇ καὶ τῷ δήμῳ, εἰπόντος (vel γραμματεύοντος vel simile) τοῦ δεῖνος τοῦ Ἀριστοκλέους· μεταγράψαι [ἐκ τῆς ἀρχαίας στη[λ]ης τῆς παρεστώσης τοῖς ἀγάλμασι τοῖς τοῦ Ποσειδῶνος τοῦ Ἰσθμίου τοὺς γεγ[ενημένους] ἀπὸ τῆς κτίσεως κατὰ γένος ἱερεῖς τοῦ Πο[σειδῶ]νος τοῦ καθιδρυθέντος ὑπὸ τῶν τὴν ἀποικ[ίαν ἐκ] Τροιζήνος ἀγαγόντων Ποσειδῶνι καὶ Ἀπόλλ[ωνι."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0643.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Εἰσὶν δὲ ἐν αὐτῇ ἱερεῖς τοῦ Ποσειδῶνος οἷδε:"}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0643.6", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "1. Τελαμῶν Ποσειδῶνος."}
{"urn": "hellanicus.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-socrates_hist_fhg4", "locus": "socrates_hist_fhg4_0643.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "2. Ἀντίδιος Τελαμῶνος."}
